# Fast path: empty launch directory (no Harbor & Rye / ParcelPath / … samples).
# Copy this file to `.env.local`, set 0, restart `npm run dev`.
# Default (unset or 1): labeled DEMO seed is on.
# Hard path: empty DEMO_WORKPLACES / DEMO_REPORTS in src/data/seed.ts.
# See README → “Strip the demo seed”.
VITE_DEMO_SEED=1
